WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.300
A baby, just born.

2
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:06.320
Someone leans close and whispers
into the baby's right ear.

3
00:00:06.370 --> 00:00:10.970
Those first words contain one
short sentence: the Shahadah.

4
00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:14.600
Many Muslims hope it will also
be the last words they say.

5
00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:17.280
Saying it is what makes a person Muslim.

6
00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:21.650
But if one sentence does that,
what else holds up a Muslim's life?

7
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:24.660
In this mission, you'll
build the house of Islam,

8
00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:26.150
pillar by pillar.

9
00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:29.440
Then you'll look closely
at that one short sentence,

10
00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:31.880
and where it appears in a Muslim's life.

11
00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:35.680
Your mission: find out
what, besides one sentence,

12
00:00:35.730 --> 00:00:37.410
holds up a Muslim's life.
